The **`502 (Bad Gateway)`** and CORS message happened because Nginx couldn't reach the Python API container on port 3001.

When the API container is restarting, rebuilding, or stalled on boot, Nginx returns a 502 page. Because Nginx's built-in 502 error page doesn't have CORS headers, your browser flags it as `net::ERR_FAILED 502 (Bad Gateway) + blocked by CORS`.

---

### Step 1: Run the Direct Column Update on PostgreSQL

Run this command on your VPS terminal right now. It directly adds all missing columns in PostgreSQL in 1 second:

```bash
docker compose exec -T postgres psql -U shaliach -d shaliach_prod -c "
ALTER TABLE campaigns ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS prompt_guidelines TEXT;
ALTER TABLE campaigns ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS template_subject VARCHAR;
ALTER TABLE campaigns ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS template_body_text TEXT;
ALTER TABLE campaigns ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS template_body_html TEXT;
ALTER TABLE campaigns ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS scheduled_at TIMESTAMPTZ;
ALTER TABLE campaigns ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS started_at TIMESTAMPTZ;
ALTER TABLE campaigns ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS completed_at TIMESTAMPTZ;
ALTER TABLE leads ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS normalized_email VARCHAR;
ALTER TABLE leads ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS source VARCHAR;
ALTER TABLE leads ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS last_reply_at TIMESTAMPTZ;
ALTER TABLE leads ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS expected_revenue NUMERIC(12, 2) DEFAULT 0;
ALTER TABLE leads ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS confirmed_revenue NUMERIC(12, 2) DEFAULT 0;
ALTER TABLE leads ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS follow_up_date TIMESTAMPTZ;
"
```

---

### Step 2: Pull the Startup Fix & Rebuild API

We updated `apps/api/app/database.py` (commit `5954bff`) so Python boots cleanly using individual autocommit connections without any transaction lockups.

Run this on your VPS:

```bash
cd /opt/shaliach
git pull origin main
docker compose up -d --build api worker
```

---

### Step 3: Verify the Container is Running

Run:

```bash
docker logs --tail 20 shaliach-api
```

You will see:
```text
INFO:     Application startup complete.
INFO:     Uvicorn running on http://0.0.0.0:3001 (Press CTRL+C to quit)
```

As soon as Uvicorn is listening on port 3001, refresh your browser at **`https://shaliach.fixhubtech.com`** and the 502 error will disappear!

